{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 03:01:42", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-9ac5920f-598a-4c07-92a3-74991d76c246', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/project-view/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Project View Dashboard",\n  "project_id": "a2d7d1ab",\n  "context": "Implement comprehensive Project View Dashboard with SDLC tracking"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FFiGGWnfBKwEDo8PzYsgfH', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/project-view/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01FFiGGWnfBKwEDo8PzYsgfH', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Project View Dashboard Requirements\\n\\n## Overview\\nAdd a dedicated Project View to the Ensemble UI that provides comprehensive visibility into a project\'s status, SDLC position, milestone progress, and next steps with actionable controls.\\n\\n## User Vision\\n\\"Let\'s add a project view, so we can see a project view, its status, its position in the SDLC, the number of milestones determined, the number completed, and next steps along with a \'continue to next step\' button to force the agent system to move to implementation.\\"\\n\\n## Objectives\\n\\n### Primary Goals\\n1. **Project Status Visibility**: Display comprehensive project status at a glance\\n2. **SDLC Position Tracking**: Show where the project is in the Software Development Lifecycle\\n3. **Milestone Progress**: Display milestone counts (total, completed, remaining)\\n4. **Next Steps Visibility**: Show actionable next steps for the project\\n5. **Manual Control**: Provide \\"Continue to Next Step\\" button to force advancement\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Users can view project status without navigating multiple screens\\n- SDLC phase is clearly visible (requirements \\u2192 architecture \\u2192 planning \\u2192 implementation \\u2192 testing \\u2192 complete)\\n- Milestone progress shows as numerical count and visual progress indicator\\n- Next steps are clearly listed with descriptions\\n- \\"Continue to Next Step\\" button triggers agent system to advance implementation\\n\\n## Functional Requirements\\n\\n### FR-1: Project Selection\\n- Display list of active projects (from `/api/projects/summary` or project tracker)\\n- Allow selection of a specific project to view details\\n- Show project name, created date, and current status in list\\n\\n### FR-2: Project Status Display\\n- Show overall project status: active, paused, completed, failed\\n- Display project name and description\\n- Show creation timestamp and last update timestamp\\n- Display associated request_id for tracing\\n\\n### FR-3: SDLC Position Indicator\\n- Visual indicator showing current phase:\\n  - Requirements\\n  - Architecture\\n  - Planning (task breakdown)\\n  - Implementation\\n  - Testing\\n  - Complete\\n- Phase should be determined from project tracking data or Executive Director output\\n\\n### FR-4: Milestone Tracking\\n- Display total number of milestones determined\\n- Show number of milestones completed\\n- Show number of milestones remaining/in-progress\\n- Visual progress bar (completed/total)\\n- List individual milestones with their status\\n\\n### FR-5: Task Summary\\n- Show task counts by status (todo, in_progress, completed, blocked)\\n- Completion percentage\\n- Link to detailed task view if available\\n\\n### FR-6: Next Steps Display\\n- List next actionable steps for the project\\n- Show which tasks can be started (no blocking dependencies)\\n- Display agent assignments for pending tasks\\n\\n### FR-7: Continue to Next Step Button\\n- Button to trigger continuation of project execution\\n- When clicked:\\n  - Spawn a new Executive Director with context to continue\\n  - Pass project_id and current state\\n  - Include instruction to proceed to next phase/milestone\\n- Visual feedback during execution (loading state)\\n- Error handling for failed continuations\\n\\n### FR-8: Agent Activity for Project\\n- Show currently running agents for this project\\n- Display recent agent activity\\n- Link to agent hierarchy for the project\\n\\n## Technical Requirements\\n\\n### Backend Integration\\n\\n#### Existing Endpoints to Leverage\\n- `GET /api/projects/summary` - List projects with summary stats\\n- `GET /api/activity/hierarchy` - Agent hierarchy for project\\n- `GET /api/requests/{request_id}/timeline` - Timeline data\\n- `POST /api/generate-solution` - For continuation functionality\\n\\n#### New/Enhanced Endpoints Needed\\n- `GET /api/projects/{project_id}/details` - Detailed project view with milestones\\n- `POST /api/projects/{project_id}/continue` - Trigger project continuation\\n\\n### Data Sources\\n- Project Tracker (`~/.ensemble/projects/`) - SDLC state, milestones, notes\\n- Swarm State (SQLite) - Active agents, session data\\n- Activity Tracker - Recent activities\\n\\n### Frontend Components\\n- New view tab \\"Projects\\" in App.jsx navigation\\n- ProjectView.jsx - Main component\\n- ProjectStatusCard.jsx - Project header with status\\n- SDLCIndicator.jsx - Visual SDLC phase indicator\\n- MilestoneProgress.jsx - Milestone tracking display\\n- NextStepsPanel.jsx - Actionable next steps\\n\\n## UI/UX Specifications\\n\\n### Visual Design\\n- Follow existing dark theme (backgroundColor: \'#1a1d29\')\\n- Card-based layout consistent with other views\\n- Use existing Badge component for status indicators\\n- Progress bars for milestone completion\\n\\n### Layout (Desktop)\\n```\\n+--------------------------------------------------+\\n| [Navigation: Activity | Timeline | ... | Projects] |\\n+--------------------------------------------------+\\n| Project List (Left)  |  Project Details (Right)   |\\n|                      |                            |\\n| [Project 1]         | Project Name                |\\n| [Project 2] <--     | Status: Active | Phase: X   |\\n| [Project 3]         |                            |\\n|                     | SDLC Progress              |\\n|                     | [=====>------] Architecture |\\n|                     |                            |\\n|                     | Milestones                 |\\n|                     | 3/7 Complete [=====>--]    |\\n|                     |                            |\\n|                     | Next Steps                 |\\n|                     | \\u2022 Task A (assigned: Dev)   |\\n|                     | \\u2022 Task B (unassigned)      |\\n|                     |                            |\\n|                     | [Continue to Next Step]    |\\n+--------------------------------------------------+\\n```\\n\\n## Non-Functional Requirements\\n\\n### Performance\\n- Project list should load in < 500ms\\n- Project details should load in < 1s\\n- Continue action should show immediate feedback\\n\\n### Reliability\\n- Handle missing/incomplete project data gracefully\\n- Show meaningful error states\\n- Recover from backend failures\\n\\n### Accessibility\\n- Keyboard navigation for project selection\\n- Screen reader compatible status indicators\\n- Clear visual contrast for all states\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Project deletion/archival (future feature)\\n- Milestone editing (manual intervention)\\n- Budget/cost per project (exists in Cost Tracking view)\\n- Multi-project comparison view\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- Existing project_tracker.py module\\n- Backend main.py endpoints\\n- React Bootstrap UI framework\\n- Existing API service layer\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n1. Project data is available in ~/.ensemble/projects/ directory\\n2. Executive Director agents create and maintain project state\\n3. SDLC phase is tracked in project notes or result status\\n4. Backend has access to project tracker module\\n\\n## Risks\\n- SDLC phase may not be consistently tracked in current implementation\\n- Milestone data may be sparse for older projects\\n- \\"Continue\\" action may require careful context preservation\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RbPwnrZtnxy1YsFT8uobyD', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Project View Dashboard', 'description': 'Implement comprehensive Project View Dashboard with SDLC tracking, milestone progress, and continuation controls'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RbPwnrZtnxy1YsFT8uobyD', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "0cbb353b", "message": "Created project: Project View Dashboard", "summary": {"project_id": "0cbb353b", "project_name": "Project View Dashboard", "description": "Implement comprehensive Project View Dashboard with SDLC tracking, milestone progress, and continuation controls", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T02:58:39.567418", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T02:58:39.567418", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T02:58:39.567418", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Project View Dashboard\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01EKMzzLqida9SmYUSjoc93A', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Project View Dashboard - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project**: Project View Dashboard  \n**Goal**: Implement comprehensive Project View Dashboard with SDLC tracking, milestone progress, and continuation controls  \n**Total Estimated Duration**: 4-5 weeks\n\n## Milestone 1: Backend Foundation & API Development\n**Duration**: 1-2 weeks  \n**Objective**: Establish backend infrastructure and API endpoints for project data retrieval and management\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. Enhanced project tracker integration\n2. New API endpoints for project details and continuation\n3. SDLC phase tracking implementation\n4. Project data aggregation services\n\n### Key Features:\n- `GET /api/projects/{project_id}/details` - Detailed project view with milestones\n- `POST /api/projects/{project_id}/continue` - Trigger project continuation  \n- Enhanced project tracker to include SDLC phase tracking\n- Milestone and task aggregation from project tracker data\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- API endpoints return consistent project data structure\n- SDLC phase accurately determined from project state\n- Milestone counts and progress calculated correctly\n- Continue endpoint successfully spawns Executive Director with context\n- All endpoints have proper error handling\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Existing project_tracker.py module\n- Backend main.py structure\n- SQLite swarm state database\n\n## Milestone 2: Frontend Components Development\n**Duration**: 1-2 weeks  \n**Objective**: Create React components for the Project View Dashboard\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. Project selection and navigation components\n2. Project status and overview display\n3. SDLC phase indicator component\n4. Milestone progress visualization\n5. Next steps and task summary panels\n\n### Key Components:\n- `ProjectView.jsx` - Main container component\n- `ProjectStatusCard.jsx` - Project header with status\n- `SDLCIndicator.jsx` - Visual SDLC phase indicator\n- `MilestoneProgress.jsx` - Milestone tracking display\n- `NextStepsPanel.jsx` - Actionable next steps display\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- All components follow existing dark theme design\n- Responsive layout works on different screen sizes\n- Components handle loading and error states gracefully\n- Data refreshes automatically when project status changes\n- Visual indicators clearly show project progression\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Milestone 1 completion (backend APIs)\n- Existing React Bootstrap UI framework\n- API service layer integration\n\n## Milestone 3: Integration & User Interactions\n**Duration**: 1 week  \n**Objective**: Integrate frontend with backend and implement interactive features\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. Complete frontend-backend integration\n2. "Continue to Next Step" functionality\n3. Real-time status updates\n4. Error handling and user feedback\n\n### Key Features:\n- Project selection triggers API calls to load project details\n- Continue button spawns agents and shows progress feedback\n- Real-time updates of project status and agent activity\n- Comprehensive error handling with user-friendly messages\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- Users can select projects and view comprehensive details\n- Continue functionality successfully advances project execution\n- Loading states and progress indicators work correctly\n- Error messages are clear and actionable\n- Data updates in real-time without manual refresh\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Milestones 1 & 2 completion\n- Backend agent spawning infrastructure\n- WebSocket/polling for real-time updates\n\n## Milestone 4: Testing, Polish & Documentation\n**Duration**: 1 week  \n**Objective**: Comprehensive testing, performance optimization, and documentation\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. Unit tests for all React components\n2. Integration tests for API endpoints\n3. End-to-end user workflow testing\n4. Performance optimization\n5. User documentation and technical documentation\n\n### Key Activities:\n- React component testing with Jest/React Testing Library\n- Backend API testing with pytest\n- User acceptance testing for complete workflows\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Documentation for users and developers\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- All tests pass with >90% code coverage\n- Performance targets met (load times, responsiveness)\n- User documentation complete and clear\n- Technical documentation updated\n- No critical bugs or usability issues\n\n### Dependencies:\n- All previous milestones completed\n- Testing framework setup\n- Documentation standards\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n### Technical Risks:\n1. **SDLC Phase Tracking Complexity**: May require analysis of existing project data structures\n   - Mitigation: Start with simple phase detection, enhance iteratively\n\n2. **Real-time Updates Performance**: Frequent polling may impact performance\n   - Mitigation: Implement efficient caching and selective updates\n\n3. **Agent Spawning Integration**: Complex integration with existing agent infrastructure\n   - Mitigation: Thorough testing in development environment first\n\n### Project Risks:\n1. **Scope Creep**: Additional features may be requested during development\n   - Mitigation: Clear acceptance criteria and change control process\n\n2. **Data Consistency**: Project data may be inconsistent across different sources\n   - Mitigation: Robust error handling and data validation\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Users can view complete project status in under 2 seconds\n- Continue functionality successfully advances 95% of eligible projects\n- Zero data loss during project transitions\n- User satisfaction score >4.5/5 for dashboard usability'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01EKMzzLqida9SmYUSjoc93A', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025904.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025904.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01QDS2jffCki9xpuFdWHWZt6', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/project-view/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Project View Dashboard'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01QDS2jffCki9xpuFdWHWZt6', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01JN56Zgnpinnrq5S8oA8oXh', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/project-view/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Project View Dashboard', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01JN56Zgnpinnrq5S8oA8oXh', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_019jf8GXUx4dBHU6r6hdx6g1', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_019jf8GXUx4dBHU6r6hdx6g1', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Project View Dashboard - Architecture Proposal\\n\\n## A. Architecture Overview\\n\\n### Architectural Pattern: Modular Single Page Application (SPA)\\n- Frontend: React-based component-driven architecture\\n- Backend: Python Flask microservices\\n- State Management: Redux for complex UI state\\n- Communication: RESTful API with WebSocket support for real-time updates\\n\\n### Core Design Principles\\n- Modularity: Each component has a single, well-defined responsibility\\n- Scalability: Loosely coupled components that can be independently developed\\n- Performance: Minimal payload, efficient data fetching\\n- Extensibility: Easy to add new project tracking features\\n\\n## B. Tech Stack\\n\\n### Frontend\\n- **Framework**: React 18\\n- **State Management**: Redux Toolkit\\n- **UI Components**: React Bootstrap\\n- **Routing**: React Router\\n- **HTTP Client**: Axios\\n- **Testing**: Jest, React Testing Library\\n\\n### Backend\\n- **Language**: Python 3.9+\\n- **Web Framework**: Flask\\n- **API Design**: Flask-RESTful\\n- **Authentication**: JWT (Flask-JWT-Extended)\\n- **Database Access**: SQLAlchemy\\n- **WebSocket**: Flask-SocketIO\\n\\n### Infrastructure\\n- **Containerization**: Docker\\n- **Orchestration**: Docker Compose\\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions\\n- **Deployment**: Kubernetes (optional scaling)\\n\\n## C. System Components\\n\\n### Frontend Components\\n1. **ProjectViewContainer**\\n   - Manages overall project view layout\\n   - Handles project selection and data loading\\n   - Renders child components\\n\\n2. **ProjectListPanel**\\n   - Displays list of projects\\n   - Handles project selection\\n   - Filters and searches projects\\n\\n3. **ProjectStatusCard**\\n   - Shows project metadata\\n   - Displays status badges\\n   - Shows timestamps\\n\\n4. **SDLCIndicator**\\n   - Visualizes current SDLC phase\\n   - Provides phase progression tracking\\n\\n5. **MilestoneTracker**\\n   - Displays milestone progress\\n   - Shows completion percentages\\n   - Renders milestone details\\n\\n6. **NextStepsPanel**\\n   - Lists actionable next steps\\n   - Shows task assignments\\n   - Provides \\"Continue\\" functionality\\n\\n### Backend Services\\n1. **ProjectService**\\n   - Retrieves project details\\n   - Manages project lifecycle\\n   - Handles project continuation requests\\n\\n2. **MilestoneService**\\n   - Tracks milestone progress\\n   - Calculates milestone statistics\\n   - Updates milestone status\\n\\n3. **AgentActivityService**\\n   - Retrieves agent activities\\n   - Tracks running agents\\n   - Provides agent hierarchy information\\n\\n## D. File/Directory Structure\\n\\n```\\nensemble_ui/\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 frontend/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 src/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 components/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 ProjectView/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 ProjectListPanel.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 ProjectStatusCard.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 SDLCIndicator.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 MilestoneTracker.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 NextStepsPanel.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 common/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 redux/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 projectSlice.js\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 milestoneSlice.js\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 services/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 apiService.js\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 App.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 package.json\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 backend/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 services/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 project_service.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 milestone_service.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 agent_activity_service.py\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 models/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 project.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 milestone.py\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 routes/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 project_routes.py\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 app.py\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 docker-compose.yml\\n```\\n\\n## E. Data Model\\n\\n### Project Model\\n```python\\nclass Project:\\n    id: str\\n    name: str\\n    description: str\\n    status: ProjectStatus\\n    sdlc_phase: SDLCPhase\\n    created_at: datetime\\n    updated_at: datetime\\n    milestones: List[Milestone]\\n    tasks: List[Task]\\n```\\n\\n### Milestone Model\\n```python\\nclass Milestone:\\n    id: str\\n    name: str\\n    status: MilestoneStatus\\n    started_at: datetime\\n    completed_at: datetime\\n    tasks: List[Task]\\n```\\n\\n## F. API Design\\n\\n### Project Endpoints\\n- `GET /api/projects` - List projects\\n- `GET /api/projects/{project_id}` - Get project details\\n- `POST /api/projects/{project_id}/continue` - Continue project\\n\\n### Response Examples\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"project_id\\": \\"proj_123\\",\\n  \\"name\\": \\"AI Research Platform\\",\\n  \\"status\\": \\"active\\",\\n  \\"sdlc_phase\\": \\"architecture\\",\\n  \\"milestones\\": [\\n    {\\"name\\": \\"Design\\", \\"status\\": \\"completed\\"},\\n    {\\"name\\": \\"Implementation\\", \\"status\\": \\"in_progress\\"}\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## G. Deployment Strategy\\n- Docker containers for frontend and backend\\n- Nginx as reverse proxy\\n- Optional Kubernetes for horizontal scaling\\n- Environment-specific configuration management\\n\\n## H. Testing Strategy\\n- Unit Tests: \\n  - Frontend: Jest for React components\\n  - Backend: pytest for Python services\\n- Integration Tests: \\n  - API endpoint testing\\n  - Database interaction validation\\n- E2E Tests: Cypress for critical user flows\\n\\n## I. Alternatives Considered\\n1. **GraphQL vs REST**\\n   - Chose REST for simplicity and existing infrastructure\\n   - GraphQL would provide more flexible querying\\n2. **Redux vs Context API**\\n   - Redux chosen for complex state management\\n   - Provides better debugging and middleware support\\n\\n## J. Risks and Mitigations\\n- **Risk**: Inconsistent project tracking\\n  - **Mitigation**: Robust data validation, default states\\n- **Risk**: Performance with large projects\\n  - **Mitigation**: Pagination, lazy loading, caching\\n\\n## K. Open Questions\\n- Precise mechanism for \\"Continue to Next Step\\"\\n- Handling edge cases in project progression\\n- Long-term data retention strategy\\n\\n## Conclusion\\nA modular, scalable architecture that meets the Project View Dashboard requirements while providing flexibility for future enhancements."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Bk4o7AGr1MMemMXGstFKp6', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Backend Foundation & API Development - Establish backend infrastructure and API endpoints for project data retrieval and management', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/project-view/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Bk4o7AGr1MMemMXGstFKp6', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "tasks_identified": 13, "task_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "dependencies": ["Database Setup \\u2192 Authentication & Data Models", "Authentication \\u2192 Protected Endpoi