n## C. System Components\\n\\n### 1. AgentHierarchyTree (Enhanced)\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n- Render agent hierarchies\\n- Add question linking\\n- Generate and display two-word summaries\\n- Support collapsible/expandable views\\n\\n### 2. CompletedItemsSection (New Component)\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n- Manage and display completed tasks/agents\\n- Provide toggle for showing/hiding completed items\\n- Maintain completed items count\\n\\n### 3. MetricsPane (New Component)\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n- Display model usage metrics\\n- Show code delta information\\n- Real-time updates via polling mechanism\\n\\n### 4. Layout Manager\\n**Responsibilities:**\\n- Implement responsive grid adjustments\\n- Manage column width redistributions\\n- Handle section collapsibility\\n\\n## D. File/Directory Structure\\n```\\nsrc/\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 components/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 AgentHierarchyTree/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 index.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 QuestionLink.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 SummaryGenerator.js\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 CompletedItemsSection/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 index.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 MetricsPane/\\n\\u2502   \\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 index.jsx\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 common/\\n\\u2502       \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 CollapsibleSection.jsx\\n\\u2502       \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 ResponsiveGrid.jsx\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 services/\\n\\u2502   \\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 api.js         # Existing API service\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 metricsService.js  # New metrics data fetching\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 utils/\\n\\u2502   \\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 textProcessing.js  # Summary generation utilities\\n\\u2514\\u2500\\u2500 App.jsx\\n```\\n\\n## E. Data Flow & State Management\\n\\n### State Propagation\\n- Use React Context for global state management\\n- Lightweight hooks-based approach\\n- Polling mechanism integrated into services\\n\\n### Data Fetching Strategy\\n- Maintain existing 500ms-2s polling interval\\n- Add new `/api/metrics` endpoint handler\\n- Implement defensive error handling\\n\\n## F. API Design\\n\\n### New Metrics Endpoint\\n```json\\nGET /api/metrics\\nResponse: {\\n  \\"models\\": {\\n    \\"haiku\\": 5,\\n    \\"sonnet\\": 3,\\n    \\"opus\\": 1\\n  },\\n  \\"code_delta\\": {\\n    \\"lines_added\\": 245,\\n    \\"lines_removed\\": 89,\\n    \\"files_changed\\": 12\\n  },\\n  \\"last_updated\\": \\"2024-01-11T02:56:00Z\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## G. Deployment Strategy\\n- Existing React build process\\n- No changes to deployment pipeline\\n- Compatibility with current hosting infrastructure\\n\\n## H. Testing Strategy\\n\\n### Component Testing\\n- Jest snapshot testing\\n- React Testing Library for interaction tests\\n- 90%+ code coverage goal\\n\\n### Testing Focus Areas\\n- Question link generation\\n- Metrics display accuracy\\n- Collapsible section behaviors\\n- Responsive layout rendering\\n\\n## I. Risks and Mitigations\\n\\n### 1. Performance Overhead\\n**Risk**: New components might slow rendering\\n**Mitigation**: \\n- Use React.memo\\n- Implement lazy loading\\n- Optimize polling intervals\\n\\n### 2. Browser Compatibility\\n**Risk**: New features might break in older browsers\\n**Mitigation**:\\n- Test across modern browsers\\n- Provide graceful degradation\\n- Use well-supported React patterns\\n\\n## J. Open Questions for Stakeholder Review\\n1. Preferred method of question linking (scroll vs. navigate)\\n2. Desired default state for completed items section (collapsed/expanded)\\n3. Specific preferences for two-word summary generation algorithm\\n\\n## K. Implementation Phases\\n1. AgentHierarchyTree Enhancements\\n2. Completed Items Section\\n3. Metrics Pane\\n4. Layout Adjustments\\n5. Comprehensive Testing\\n\\n## Architecture Decision Record\\n- Maintained existing React + Bootstrap stack\\n- Chose modular, minimally invasive approach\\n- Prioritized