ress.jsx for milestone tracking\n- NextStepsPanel.jsx for actionable next steps\n- API service functions in api.js\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✅ All components render correctly with mock data\n- ✅ State management follows existing App.jsx patterns\n- ✅ Components handle loading and error states gracefully\n- ✅ UI follows existing dark theme styling patterns\n- ✅ Component hierarchy matches architecture specification\n- ✅ API integration functions implemented and tested\n\n**Dependencies**: \n- Milestone 1 (Backend APIs)\n- Existing UI component patterns review\n\n### Milestone 3: Integration and User Experience\n**Duration**: 1 week  \n**Objective**: Integrate components, implement user interactions, and polish UX\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Complete ProjectView integration into App.jsx\n- "Continue to Next Step" button functionality\n- Project list selection and details display\n- Loading states and error handling\n- Confirmation dialogs for actions\n- Auto-refresh capability (optional)\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✅ Full user workflow functional: navigate → select → view → continue\n- ✅ "Continue to Next Step" triggers backend properly\n- ✅ UI provides appropriate feedback for all actions\n- ✅ Error states display helpful user messages\n- ✅ Performance meets targets across all interactions\n- ✅ Responsive design works on different screen sizes\n\n**Dependencies**: \n- Milestone 2 (Frontend Components)\n- Backend API availability\n\n### Milestone 4: Testing and Documentation\n**Duration**: 0.5 weeks  \n**Objective**: Comprehensive testing coverage and documentation completion\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Backend unit tests for SDLC detection logic\n- Backend integration tests for all new endpoints\n- Frontend component rendering tests\n- Frontend user interaction tests\n- Error state testing\n- Complete API documentation\n- User guide documentation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✅ Backend test coverage > 90% for new code\n- ✅ Frontend test coverage > 85% for new components\n- ✅ All integration tests pass\n- ✅ Error scenarios properly tested\n- ✅ API documentation matches implementation\n- ✅ User guide covers all features\n- ✅ Code review completed and approved\n\n**Dependencies**: \n- Milestone 3 (Complete Integration)\n- Testing framework setup\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n### High Risk\n- **SDLC Phase Detection Complexity**: Logic for determining current phase from project notes might be ambiguous\n- **Continue Button Integration**: Spawning Executive Director agent needs careful error handling\n\n### Medium Risk\n- **Performance Targets**: Meeting <500ms list and <1s details requirements\n- **State Management**: Ensuring consistent React state patterns\n\n### Low Risk\n- **UI Styling**: Following existing patterns should be straightforward\n- **Component Structure**: Clear hierarchy defined in architecture\n\n## Success Metrics\n- All acceptance criteria met for each milestone\n- Performance targets achieved\n- Zero critical bugs in production\n- User workflow completion rate > 95%\n- Test coverage targets met\n\n## Project Timeline\n**Total Duration**: 4 weeks\n- Week 1: Milestone 1 (Backend)\n- Week 2-3.5: Milestone 2 (Frontend Core)\n- Week 3.5-4: Milestone 3 (Integration)\n- Week 4: Milestone 4 (Testing & Docs)\n\n**Critical Path**: Backend APIs → Core Components → Integration → Testing'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Fjv8PuzvH5gbWzAwiz4wRQ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025916.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025916.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01PocT2mDNPgM6CC6i7u1CdN', 'name': 'spawn_age