for `/api/activity/files`\n- [ ] Generated files appear correctly in UI\n- [ ] Graceful error handling when backend unavailable\n- [ ] All existing functionality preserved\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Milestone 1 completion\n- Frontend development environment\n- Test file generation capability\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\n### High Risk:\n- Backend configuration issues preventing startup\n- Database connectivity problems\n\n### Medium Risk:\n- CORS configuration conflicts\n- Frontend polling logic issues\n\n### Low Risk:\n- Response format inconsistencies\n- Error message display problems\n\n## Rollback Plan\nIf issues arise:\n1. Revert backend changes to last working state\n2. Disable file polling temporarily in frontend\n3. Document known issues for future resolution\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Zero 404 errors on `/api/activity/files` endpoint\n- Files display correctly in UI within 2 seconds of generation\n- No regression in other API endpoints\n- Clean error logs without spam'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01PqVfhFj2iQRfxcUh2Edhxx', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025845.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_025845.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01QjF8pM8mRWmL83B1uGQnPQ', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/completed/ui_files_404_fix_requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'UI Files 404 Err