havior or interactions\n\n## Target Files\nBased on analysis, the main styling is controlled by:\n- `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/index.css` - Contains the current dark theme with `background-color: #1a1d29`\n\n## Technical Constraints\n- Must maintain Bootstrap compatibility\n- Preserve existing CSS class structure\n- Ensure all text remains readable\n- Follow existing code patterns and conventions\n\n## Success Criteria\n1. Web UI displays with dark green background instead of dark blue\n2. All text and UI elements remain clearly visible and readable\n3. No visual artifacts or styling issues introduced\n4. Application functions exactly as before\n\n## Assumptions\n- Current dark blue color is #1a1d29 (confirmed in index.css)\n- A suitable dark green equivalent would be approximately #1a291d or similar\n- Only the main background color needs to change\n- User wants a simple color swap without extensive theme redesign'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011KUh2zzUaMMDNCkpXFVHoy', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_143802.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260116_143802.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01A6ThuvQKqKgW6AqHyks3wB', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '63ced27e', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Requirements analysis complete. Identified target file: /src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/index.css with current dark blue background #1a1d29 that needs to be changed to dark green.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01A6ThuvQKqKgW6AqHyks3wB', 'content': '{"success