of Scope\\n- Major UI redesign or layout changes\\n- Adding new features or functionality\\n- Changing colors other than background unless needed for accessibility\\n- Modifying component behavior or interactions\\n\\n## Target Files\\nBased on analysis, the main styling is controlled by:\\n- `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/index.css` - Contains the current dark theme with `background-color: #1a1d29`\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Must maintain Bootstrap compatibility\\n- Preserve existing CSS class structure\\n- Ensure all text remains readable\\n- Follow existing code patterns and conventions\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n1. Web UI displays with dark green background instead of dark blue\\n2. All text and UI elements remain clearly visible and readable\\n3. No visual artifacts or styling issues introduced\\n4. Application functions exactly as before\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Current dark blue color is #1a1d29 (confirmed in index.css)\\n- A suitable dark green equivalent would be approximately #1a291d or similar\\n- Only the main background color needs to change\\n- User wants a simple color swap without extensive theme redesign"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01BfqymvaguoeJJvivyZBY5A', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Web UI Background Color Change - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nSimple background color change from dark blue to dark green while maintaining all functionality and accessibility.\n\n## Milestone 1: Background Color Update (Complete Project)\n**Duration**: 1-2 hours\n**Priority**: High\n\n### Objective\nChange the web UI background color from dark blue (#1a1d29) to dark green while ensuring accessibility and visual consistency.\n\n### Deliverables\n1. Updated CSS with new dark green background color\n2. Accessibility verification (contrast ratios)\n3. Visual testing across different browsers\n4. Documentation of color changes made\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ Background color changed from #1a1d29 (dark blue) to appropriate dark green\n- ✅ All text remains readable with proper contrast ratios\n- ✅ No visual artifacts or broken layouts\n- ✅ Application functions identically to before\n- ✅ Changes committed to version control\n\n### Dependencies\n- Access to CSS files\n- Ability to test in browser\n- Color accessibility validation\n\n### Technical Details\n- Primary target: `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/index.css`\n- Proposed color: #1a291d (dark green equivalent)\n- Maintain Bootstrap compatibility\n- Preserve existing class structure\n\n### Risk Assessment\n**Low Risk Project**\n- Single file change\n- Simple color substitution\n- No functional modifications\n- Easy to revert if issues\n\n### Definition of Done\n- Background displays in dark green\n- All UI elements visible and functional\n- Code committed with descriptive message\n- Quick visual test completed'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01BfqymvaguoeJJvivyZBY5A', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_143828.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_143828.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept